ecord runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025 across 7 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 32 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle got 48% of normal in July to August and 38% in August to September. Grid 29930 has a preliminary estimate of 70.1 for August to September 2026, which is not RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
